medium text-muted-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles size-3.5 text-accent" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg>Philosophy Corner</span><h2 class="mt-6 text-balance font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-5xl">Growth you can hold onto</h2><p class="mt-4 text-pretty text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">A steady stream of psychology and philosophy to carry with you — because real solutions start with a resilient mind.</p></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3"><figure class="glass relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-primary/30 bg-card p-8 lg:col-span-2 lg:row-span-2"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[radial-gradient(70%_70%_at_20%_0%,color-mix(in_oklch,var(--primary)_18%,transparent),transparent)]"></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-quote size-10 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path></svg><blockquote class="mt-6 text-balance font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-snug text-foreground sm:text-4xl">The wound is the place where the light enters you.</blockquote><figcaption class="mt-8 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><span class="font-semibold text-foreground">Rumi</span> · <!-- -->On resilience</figcaption></figure><figure class="glass flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6"><blockquote class="text-pretty text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed text-foreground">“<!-- -->Between stimulus and response there is a space. In that space is our power to choose our response.<!-- -->”</blockquote><figcaption class="mt-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><span class="font-semibold text-foreground">Viktor Frankl</span> · <!-- -->Man's Search for Meaning</figcaption></figure><figure class="glass flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6"><blockquote class="text-pretty text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed text-foreground">“<!-- -->What lies behind us and what lies before us are tiny matters compared to what lies within us.<!-- -->”</blockquote><figcaption class="mt-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><span class="font-semibold text-foreground">Ralph Waldo Emerson</span> · <!-- -->On inner strength</figcaption></figure></div><div class="mt-5 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-3"><figure class="glass flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6"><blockquote class="text-pretty text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-foreground">“<!-- -->You are not your thoughts. You are the awareness watching them arrive and let go.<!-- -->”</blockquote><figcaption class="mt-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><span class="font-semibold text-foreground">Modern mindfulness</span> · <!-- -->On self-compassion</figcaption></figure><figure class="glass flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6"><blockquote class="text-pretty text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-foreground">“<!-- -->Growth is not found in a smooth path, but in mastering rough terrain with a steady heart.<!-- -->”</blockquote><figcaption class="mt-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><span class="font-semibold text-foreground">StorieZ Philosophy Corner</span> · <!-- -->Community principle</figcaption></figure><figure class="glass flex flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6"><blockquote class="text-pretty text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-foreground">“<!-- -->Fall seven times, stand up eight.<!-- -->”</blockquote><figcaption class="mt-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><span class="font-semibold text-foreground">Japanese proverb</span> · <!-- -->On persistence</figcaption></figure></div><ul class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3"><li class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-accent/30 bg-accent/10 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles size-3.5 text-accent" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg>Your story is still being written.</li><li class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-accent/30 bg-accent/10 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles size-3.5 text-accent" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg>Small steps forward still count as forward.</li><li class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-accent/30 bg-accent/10 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles size-3.5 text-accent" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg>You have survived 100% of your hardest days.</li><li class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-accent/30 bg-accent/10 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles size-3.5 text-accent" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg>Progress over perfection, always.</li></ul></section><section id="